  "summary": "Malicious code in @ornikar/eslint-config-typescript-react (npm)",
  "details": "Version 24.0.1 of this ESLint config package is a trojanized release. The preinstall hook (setup.mjs) downloads the Bun JavaScript runtime from github[.]com/oven-sh/bun and uses it to execute a 727KB obfuscated payload file (math_init.js). The legitimate ESLint config files are still present in the package to disguise the attack. The package size jumped from ~42KB to 780KB, and the preinstall hook was added for the first time in 171 versions. The payload's runtime behaviour is concealed by heavy obfuscation and Bun-compiled bytecode.",
